/*⁣​‌‌‍‍​⁠‌‌​​‍⁠⁠‍​‌​​⁠‌‌‍​​‍‍‌​​​‍⁠‌⁠​⁠‌⁠‍‌‍‍‌‌⁠⁠⁠‍‍‍⁠​⁠‌‌‍⁠⁠‌‍‍‌​⁣ 微信.池谕 — nuojiji notification bar theme */

:root {
/* 日间模式基础变量 */
--nuo-notif-bg: rgba(245, 245, 245, 0.95);
--nuo-notif-radius: 24px;
--nuo-notif-avatar-radius: 12px;
--nuo-notif-title-color: #000000;
--nuo-notif-message-color: #333333;
--nuo-notif-time-color: #999999;
--nuo-notif-avatar-size: 41px;
/* 锁屏卡片也用这些变量 */
--nuo-notif-lock-bg: transparent; /* 用class覆盖，这里设透明 */
--nuo-notif-lock-radius: 24px;
--nuo-notif-lock-text-color: var(--nuo-notif-title-color);
--nuo-notif-lock-message-color: var(--nuo-notif-message-color);
}
/* --- 通用头像修复 (横幅+锁屏) --- */
.banner-avatar, .lock-notif-avatar {
content: '' !important;
background-image: url('https://i.postimg.cc/YC3qJ0jx/IMG-5597.png') !important;
background-size: cover !important;
background-position: center !important;
background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
}
/* --- 日间模式样式 (横幅+锁屏) --- */
.ios-notification-banner, .lock-notif-item {
background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15) !important;
backdrop-filter: blur(25px) saturate(180%) !important;
-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(25px) saturate(180%) !important;
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2) !important;
}
/* --- 横幅独有尺寸设定 --- */
.ios-notification-banner {
margin-top: -13px !important;
min-height: 66px !important;
max-height: 72px !important;
padding: 8px 14px !important;
align-items: center !important;
display: flex !important;
}
/* --- 自动夜间模式 (横幅+锁屏) ---💖删掉为纯日间 */
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
:root {
--nuo-notif-bg: rgba(30, 30, 30, 0.6);
--nuo-notif-title-color: #ffffff;
--nuo-notif-message-color: #e0e0e0;
}
.ios-notification-banner, .lock-notif-item {
background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) !important;
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) !important;
}
}
/* --- 横幅排版和文字截断 --- */
.banner-message {
line-height: 1.2 !important;
transform: translateY(-3px) !important;
padding-right: 10px !important;
display: -webkit-box !important;
-webkit-line-clamp: 2 !important;
-webkit-box-orient: vertical !important;
overflow: hidden !important;
text-overflow: ellipsis !important;
}
.banner-title {
transform: translateY(1px) !important;
}
.banner-time {
font-size: 0 !important;
transform: translateY(-1px) !importan;
}
.banner-time::after {
content: '现在';
font-size: 12px !important;
color: var(--nuo-notif-time-color);
}

